  "_comment": "Backtest factory v2 spec library. Builds on v1 by (a) adding 2 new entry primitives (macd_cross + zscore_revert), (b) using regime_filter to add trend gates on existing primitives, and (c) testing turtle-style donchian parameter sweep. Hypothesis: a regime gate (close > SMA(200)) should improve trend-following PFs by killing whipsaws in bear/chop regimes. The screen is judged by whether ANY spec passes the OOS WF gate on multiple tickers.",
